I seem to recall:
define port 3 access remote speed 9600 autobaud disable
logout port 3
define service vax1console port 3
set service vax1console port 3
connect vax1console

You may need to disable messages and/or verification for port 3 as well.  
(It has been a while since I've used one of these, although I do have one 
in front of me that is lifting my monitor a little higher.)

Tad


